INSERT INTO document_vectors (id, content, embedding) VALUES ('01a0a12a-b185-7ee8-962d-8bdc6f10c3c8', 'By paying substantially less for an asset than its calculated intrinsic worth, the investor creates a buffer against analytical errors, industry shifts, business setbacks, or broader economic downturns. The margin of safety transforms uncertain future forecasts into manageable risk by ensuring that a single miscalculation does not result in catastrophic capital loss.

---

